          "text": "Amending the Official Zoning Map of the City of Cheyenne, establishing the zoning classification AG – Agricultural for land annexed to the City of Cheyenne, located west of South Greeley Highway, south of West College Drive, and southwest of and adjacent to the intersection of Apple Street and York Avenue. (PUBLIC SERVICES COMMITTEE)"
        },
        {
          "number": "15",
          "kind": "Ordinance · 3rd reading",
          "text": "Amending the Official Zoning Map of the City of Cheyenne, changing the zoning classification for land located west of South Greeley Highway, south of West College Drive, and southwest of and adjacent to the intersection of Apple Street and York Avenue from AG – Agricultural to LI – Light Industrial."
        },
        {
