          "text": "Amending the Future Land Use Map of PlanCheyenne by changing the land use designation from Agricultural/Rural, Open Space and Parks, and Mixed-Use Employment to Community Business and removing the Natural and Cultural Resources area designation for property generally located south of Interstate 80, southeast of Otto Road, and west of Interstate 25. (Postponed from September 28, 2026)"
